license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/McNicol-Lab/birks-1973-skye-veg-survey"
abstract: >
  Tidy digitisation of present-vegetation phytosociological relevés from
  H. J. B. Birks (1973), Past and Present Vegetation of the Isle of Skye
  (Cambridge University Press), Part II. The deposit includes 520 plots,
  897 taxa, and 26,799 long-table observations (including coded absences),
  with OS grid references and WGS84 coordinates where available. License
  covers the digitisation and derived fields, not CUP page scans.
keywords:
  - phytosociology
  - vegetation survey
  - Isle of Skye
  - Scotland
  - Domin scale
  - Birks
references:
  - type: book
    authors:
      - family-names: Birks
        given-names: H. J. B.
    title: "Past and Present Vegetation of the Isle of Skye"
    publisher: "Cambridge University Press"
    year: 1973
    notes: "Part II. The Present Flora and Vegetation of the Isle of Skye, pp. 11–220. Field data collected ca. 1966–1969."
